Text: 4.1. Experiment Setup We implement the GPT-2 model based on the transform- ers library (Wolf et al., 2019). The model conﬁguration is 8 attention heads per layer, 8 layers, 512 embedding di- mensions, and 1024 feed-forward layer dimensions. We employ the OpenAIAdam optimizer and train the model with 400,000 steps in total on 4 NVIDIA 1080Ti GPUs.

